{title: Ik Vaari}
{artist: Ayushman Khurana}
{key: Gm}

{c: Verse 1}
Ik vaari [Gm]haan keh de mutiyare,        Ik vaari [Cm]haan keh de
Ik vaari [Gm]haan keh de mutiyare,        Ik vaari [D#]haan keh de
[Gm]Baneya main tere layiaan,        [F]Jeenda main tere layiaan
[Gm]Ravanga mai tera banke [D#]sari umra,        [Gm]Na tu jaavi mainu chhad
[F]Main ta manna tenu Rabb,        [Gm]Tere bina o tu heer [D#]meri rehna
Ik vaari [Gm]haan keh de mutiyare,        Ik vaari [Cm]haan keh de
Ik [Gm]vaari [Ik vaari],        [Gm]Pehli mohabbat ka
[Cm]Ehsaas hai tu,        [Dm]Bujhke bhi bujh na paayi
[D#]Woh pyaas hai tu,        [Gm]Pehli mohabbat ka
[Cm]Ehsaas hai tu,        [Dm]Bujhke bhi bujh na paayi
[D#]Woh pyaas hai tu,        [Dm]Tu hi meri pehli khwahish
[Dm]Tu hi aakhiri hai,        [Gm]Meri zindagi hai
[F]Meri har khushi hai,        [Cm]Meri rooh ne kabki tujhko
[F]Haan keh di hai [Gm]haan keh,        Ik vaari [Gm]haan keh de mutiyare
Ik vaari [Cm]haan keh de,        Ik vaari [Gm]haan keh de mutiyare
Ik vaari [D#]haan keh de,        [Gm]Jeen di na khwahish hai
[F]Na marna gawara hai,        [Dm]Ik din main tere layi
[D#]Chhadna jag saara ae,        [Gm]Tu ni hundi neend ni aundi
[F]Kundi vi tan kehdi aa jandi,        [D#]Tu ni hundi neend ni aundi
[Gm]Kundi vi tan kehdi aa jandi,        Ik vaari [Gm]haan keh de mutiyare
Ik vaari [Cm]haan keh de,        [Gm]Har zakham dil ka mere
[Cm]Dil se duaa de,        [Dm]Khushiyaan tujhe gham saare
[D#]Mujhko Khuda de,        [Gm]Tujhko bhula na paaya
[D#]Meri bebasi hai,        [Gm]Tu [D#]meri zindagi hai
[Gm]Tu [D#]meri har khushi hai,        [Dm]Tu hi pyaar, tu hi chahat
[Cm]Tu hi aashiqui hai,        [Gm]Meri zindagi hai
[F]Meri har khushi hai,        [Cm]Meri rooh ne kabki tujhko
[F]Haan keh di hai [Gm]haan keh di,        [Gm]Laa main betha tere naal
[F]Dil diyan saari gal,        [D#]Chal mere naal chal
[F]Saari umraan,        [Gm]Dil dehe buha kholan
[F]Sachi suchi gal bolan,        [D#]Thoda jeha hun main rolan
[F]Inni khushiyaan oye,        [D#]Inni khushiyaan [Gm]
